      "name": "Digital Pod — $6,000/month creative plus digital marketing | Quantocos",
      "description": "The Digital Pod is a $6,000/month subscription team of one manager, four specialists and four AI agents covering creative production and digital marketing: SEO, AEO, paid media, landing pages and analytics. 240 credits/month.",
